#
Concrete Brackets & Delimiters
#

Bracket Any

LBrace      "{" & Bracket
RBrace      "}" & Bracket
LBracket    "[" & Bracket
RBracket    "]" & Bracket
LParen      "(" & Bracket
RParen      ")" & Bracket

Separator Any

Comma       "," & Separator
Semicolon   ";" & Separator
Colon       ":" & Separator

Join Any

Underscore  "_" & Join
